'','## Geometry and interchange checks','',f"- {fit['physical_piece_count']} separate physical solids in the placed wing-arm pair.",f"- New-part overlap findings above0.001 mm³: {len(fit['collisions'])}.",
'- Both native arm/wing assemblies solve; deliberately displaced/rotated rib datums recover to the constrained position.',
